@startuml
title Processus de déploiement de la solution

rectangle "Environnement de développement local" as DEV
rectangle "Branche développement" as DEVELOP
rectangle "Pull Request" as PR
rectangle "Branche master" as MASTER
rectangle "Serveur Uni Fiber" as SERVER
rectangle "Odoo" as ODOO

